{"seq":3,"slug":"high-frequency","title":"高频交易","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/high-frequency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hft-strategies","title":"高频交易策略分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/high-frequency/hft-strategies","wordCount":2794,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-infrastructure","title":"低延迟基础设施与技术架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/high-frequency/latency-infrastructure","wordCount":2578,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"hft-regulation","title":"高频交易监管与市场公平","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/high-frequency/hft-regulation","wordCount":3524,"readingTime":15}],"introMarkdown":"# 高频交易\n\n本章系统介绍高频交易（High-Frequency Trading, HFT）的策略、技术和监管。高频交易利用超低延迟基础设施和算法，在微秒乃至纳秒级时间尺度上执行交易，已成为现代金融市场的重要组成部分。本章首先分类梳理主流 HFT 策略，包括做市、统计套利和延迟套利；然后深入分析支撑高频交易的技术基础设施，从共址服务到 FPGA 硬件加速；最后讨论围绕 HFT 的监管争议和市场公平问题。\n"}